12	 * the original order, on SVE vector lanes. Each 32-bit element's bytes
13	 * are permuted by svtbl with the [3,2,1,0] index table (bit-exact vs
14	 * __builtin_bswap32, 50k random vectors verified); the swapped value is
15	 * stored and reloaded through svst1/svld1 (the vector store->load path
16	 * that mirrors the scalar trigger recipe's reload). Input is random
17	 * (framework RNG at init), reused per iteration exactly as the original.
18	 * @endparblock
19	 */
